#: ../../reference_manual/seexpr.rst:314
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The ``hsi`` function shifts the hue by ``h`` (in degrees) and scales the "
"saturation and intensity by ``s`` and ``i`` respectively. A map may be "
"supplied which will control the shift - the full shift will happen when the "
"map is one and no shift will happen when the map is zero. The shift will be "
"scaled back for values between zero and one."
msgstr ""
"Funkcija ''njegova'' premika odtenek za ''h'' (v stopinjah) in meri "
"zasičenost in intenzivnost za ''s'' oziroma ''i''. Na voljo je lahko "
"zemljevid, ki bo nadziral premik - popolna izmena se bo zgodila, ko je "
"zemljevid ena in se ne bo zgodila nobena izmena, ko je zemljevid nič. Premik "
"se bo meril nazaj za vrednosti med ničlo in eno."

