msgid "color **rgbtohsl** ( color rgb )"
msgstr "barva **rgbtohsl** ( barva rgb )"

#: ../../reference_manual/seexpr.rst:323
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"RGB to HSL color space conversion. HSL is Hue, Saturation, Lightness (all in "
"the range ``[0, 1]``). These functions have also been extended to support "
"RGB and HSL values outside of the range ``[0, 1]`` in a reasonable way. For "
"any RGB or HSL value (except for negative values), the conversion is well-"
"defined and reversible."
msgstr ""
"RGB v pretvorbo barvnega prostora HSL. HSL je Hue, Saturation, Lightness "
"(vse v območju ''[0, 1]''). Te funkcije so bile razširjene tudi tako, da na "
"razumen način podpirajo vrednosti RGB in HSL zunaj obsega »[0, 1]«. Za "
"katero koli vrednost RGB ali HSL (razen negativnih vrednosti) je konverzija "
"dobro definirana in reverzibilna."

#: ../../reference_manual/seexpr.rst:329
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"color **midhsi** ( color x, float h, float s, float i, float map, float "
"falloff=1, int interp=0 )"
msgstr ""
"barva **midhsi** ( barva x, float h, float s, float i, float map, float "
"falloff=1, int interp=0 )"

#: ../../reference_manual/seexpr.rst:331
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The ``midhsi`` function is just like the ``hsi`` function except that the "
"control map is centered around the mid point (value of ``0.5``) and can "
"scale the shift in both directions. At the mid point, no shift happens. At "
"*1.0*, the full shift happens, and at ``0.0``, the full inverse shift "
"happens. Additional ``falloff`` and ``interp`` controls are provided to "
"adjust the map using the ``remap`` function. The default ``falloff`` and "
"``interp`` values result in no remapping."
msgstr ""
"Funkcija ''midhsi'' je prav tako kot funkcija ''njegova'', le da je "
"kontrolna karta usmerjena okoli sredine točke (vrednost ''0,5'') in lahko "
"preusmerja premik v obe smeri. Na sredini se ne zgodi nobena izmena. Pri "
"*1.0*se zgodi polna izmena, pri »0,0« pa se zgodi polna inverza. Dodatni "
"kontrolniki \"falloff\" in \"interp\" so na voljo za prilagoditev zemljevida "
"s funkcijo \"remap\". Privzete vrednosti »falloff« in »interp« ne pomenijo "
"nobenega preslikave."

